      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/10/24/237301566/bba303e761f32fd3a0f5d7b4af7d10f3_4371643693114715522.png",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "Under certain circumstances, obtaining intel can unlock special dialogue options...",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/10/24/237301566/670f6b2fd29475684524cc65edb2e123_637753495826465670.png",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "You can obtain up to 6 pieces of intel each week. After obtaining intel, Curatorium of Secrets characters can head to the Adventurers' Guild to trade it with Katheryne for \"classified information\".",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/10/24/237301566/6110caa8a0dea1afde0c3d854b5ab858_6502737638208524228.png",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "Classified information can be used to unlock new Intel Quests, which can, in turn, be completed to earn rewards and unlock new quests related to Curatorium of Secrets characters.",
